  "description": {
    "en": "MSV Co Focus is a round co-polyester string made from the same material platform as the highly regarded Focus Hex, but without the shaped profile. It is designed for club and Tour players with powerful groundstrokes who want a strong combination of spin, control, durability and tension maintenance. Its smooth round construction provides excellent snapback and makes it particularly useful in hybrid setups. Independent testing referenced by MSV has also highlighted strong spin potential, reduced tension loss and long-lasting playability.",

    "zh": "MSV Co Focus 是一款采用圆形截面的共聚酯球线，使用与 Focus Hex 相同的核心材料体系，但取消了六边形结构。它面向拥有强大底线击球能力的俱乐部及巡回赛级球员，在旋转、控制、耐久以及保磅之间提供非常均衡的表现。圆形光滑结构能够提供优秀 Snap-back，同时也非常适合作为 Hybrid 混穿中的低摩擦聚酯横线。MSV 所引用的多项第三方测试也显示其具有较高旋转潜力、较低张力损失以及长期稳定的可打性。"
  },

